WEBVTT

00:00:46.060 --> 00:00:51.740
<i>That's how it always starts...</i>
<i>under the azure sky</i>

00:00:51.740 --> 00:00:58.900
<i>After making a vow,</i>
<i>I now set off</i>

00:01:11.520 --> 00:01:18.030
<i>Yeah, the desert glitters with a golden hue</i>
<i>(The wind is scorching)</i>

00:01:18.030 --> 00:01:24.370
<i>I'm searching for a diamond flower</i>
<i>(I keep on wandering)</i>

00:01:24.370 --> 00:01:30.710
<i>Now, for the first time in my life,</i>

00:01:30.710 --> 00:01:37.050
<i>I live for someone else</i>

00:01:37.050 --> 00:01:43.550
<i>There's something</i>
<i>I wanna protect</i>

00:01:43.550 --> 00:01:50.060
<i>I'll never,</i>
<i>ever lose it again</i>

00:01:50.060 --> 00:01:53.060
<i>Resound,</i>
<i>my heartbeat!</i>

00:01:53.060 --> 00:02:03.060
<i>A heartbeat smaller and fragile,</i>
<i>but tougher than anyone's.</i>

00:02:16.120 --> 00:02:19.680
"Little Cat"

00:02:23.690 --> 00:02:28.430
I heard it's a rough neighborhood,
but it's a good place to lie low.

00:02:46.380 --> 00:02:48.040
D- don't laugh!

00:02:49.720 --> 00:02:53.720
Tada!! Kyoko returns!!

00:02:53.720 --> 00:02:55.060
We bought these...

00:02:55.060 --> 00:02:57.390
Oh, you saved me!

00:02:57.390 --> 00:02:59.390
I can finally dress normal.

00:02:59.390 --> 00:03:01.330
Here you go, Kuro-<i>sama</i>!

00:03:01.330 --> 00:03:03.360
Oh? Let me see...

00:03:05.330 --> 00:03:08.340
You look so cute, Kuro-<i>sama</i>!

00:03:08.340 --> 00:03:13.010
I've always wanted a little brother like this!

00:03:13.010 --> 00:03:14.240
Next!

00:03:16.340 --> 00:03:17.350
They look good on you, Train!

00:03:17.350 --> 00:03:18.680
You look cute, really...

00:03:18.680 --> 00:03:22.170
Wow! You look lovely, Kuro-<i>sama</i>!

00:03:25.020 --> 00:03:28.690
Hmm... looks pretty good.

00:03:28.690 --> 00:03:34.030
Anyway, we have to think of a way
to get you back to normal again.

00:03:34.030 --> 00:03:36.030
Not to worry!

00:03:36.030 --> 00:03:39.030
If I just keep eating and
sleeping a lot, I'll be good as new.

00:03:39.030 --> 00:03:41.040
You don't have a cold!

00:03:41.040 --> 00:03:44.230
Actually, that may work for Train.

00:03:46.040 --> 00:03:50.040
If you were shot by that weirdo doctor
in the Apostles of the Stars,

00:03:50.040 --> 00:03:52.710
rather than this being
the result of Shinkitou or Tao,

00:03:52.710 --> 00:03:56.050
it's probably something
related to nanotech...

00:03:56.050 --> 00:03:57.050
Nanotech?

00:03:57.050 --> 00:03:59.390
Right, nanotech...

00:03:59.390 --> 00:04:01.250
Nanotech...

00:04:05.330 --> 00:04:08.660
Well, it seems a little different
from Eve's case, though...

00:04:08.660 --> 00:04:11.330
Eve... Nanotech...

00:04:11.330 --> 00:04:14.340
Nanotech? Eve!

00:04:14.340 --> 00:04:18.010
If that's the case,

00:04:18.010 --> 00:04:20.680
then, I wonder if I have
"transform" ability, too...

00:04:20.680 --> 00:04:21.340
Huh?

00:04:21.340 --> 00:04:22.680
Transform...

00:04:22.680 --> 00:04:25.010
Wing!

00:04:25.010 --> 00:04:26.280
Huh?

00:04:33.690 --> 00:04:35.360
That hurt!

00:04:35.360 --> 00:04:38.360
Sven! My wings aren't appearing!!

00:04:38.360 --> 00:04:40.030
Of course not, idiot...

00:04:40.030 --> 00:04:42.360
Man, that sucks!

00:04:42.360 --> 00:04:45.700
Oh well, I guess I have no other choice
but to take a walk on my own feet.

00:04:45.700 --> 00:04:48.040
Oh, wait, Kuro-<i>sama</i>!

00:04:48.040 --> 00:04:50.300
I'm coming, too!

00:04:58.380 --> 00:04:59.710
I guess it's up to me...

00:04:59.710 --> 00:05:05.320
Eve, I'm going to contact Rins
and try looking into this nanotech thing.

00:05:05.320 --> 00:05:07.120
So, sorry to ask you this,
but while I'm out,

00:05:07.120 --> 00:05:09.660
could you keep an eye on him
and make sure he stays out of trouble?

00:05:09.660 --> 00:05:11.560
Okay, I got it.

00:05:12.660 --> 00:05:14.150
Thanks.

00:05:16.660 --> 00:05:18.000
Here you go, sweetie.

00:05:18.000 --> 00:05:21.000
Thanks, lady.

00:05:21.000 --> 00:05:23.340
You know, Kuro-<i>sama...</i>

00:05:23.340 --> 00:05:28.240
This feels like we're on a
lovey-dovey date, don't you think!?

00:05:30.010 --> 00:05:35.020
No, no... your small stature
doesn't bother me!

00:05:35.020 --> 00:05:38.350
If we love each other, size is no matter!

00:05:38.350 --> 00:05:41.690
My goodness, I said "love"!

00:05:41.690 --> 00:05:44.690
I'll take you no matter what size you are!!

00:05:44.690 --> 00:05:46.790
I'm Kyoko the invincible!

00:05:52.700 --> 00:05:55.700
<i>Usually, I can drink at least ten bottles...</i>

00:05:55.700 --> 00:05:58.200
<i>but now, I can barely finish one bottle.</i>

00:05:59.040 --> 00:06:00.980
<i>It's not just milk...</i>

00:06:00.980 --> 00:06:04.170
<i>Everything that I'm used to</i>
<i>seeing everyday looks larger.</i>

00:06:05.650 --> 00:06:10.480
<i>The town, the people, and...</i>

00:06:13.320 --> 00:06:14.660
I got it!

00:06:14.660 --> 00:06:17.660
Fool, don't get excited
about something like that.

00:06:17.660 --> 00:06:19.180
This is how you do it.

00:06:21.000 --> 00:06:24.330
Now, relax your shoulders more,

00:06:24.330 --> 00:06:28.000
take a breath, and focus
all your attention on it.

00:06:28.000 --> 00:06:30.130
And then, shoot.

00:06:34.010 --> 00:06:37.000
What's wrong, Kuro-<i>sama</i>?

00:06:38.010 --> 00:06:40.950
Kuro-<i>sama</i>, wait for me!!

00:06:42.350 --> 00:06:45.350
Heya, Kyoko here!

00:06:45.350 --> 00:06:49.690
Oh, Miki! Yeah, I know it's been a while.

00:06:49.690 --> 00:06:52.960
Huh? Me? I'm on a date.

00:06:55.030 --> 00:07:00.030
Hey Tim... give me your answer.

00:07:00.030 --> 00:07:02.970
You'll leave that
deserted factory, won't you?

00:07:02.970 --> 00:07:04.970
Ha! As if!

00:07:04.970 --> 00:07:09.980
What? I won't be responsible for
whatever happens to that kid then.

00:07:09.980 --> 00:07:11.710
Let Meg go!

00:07:12.980 --> 00:07:17.650
It'd be better for you if you do
what I say while I'm still being nice.

00:07:17.650 --> 00:07:22.660
Or, would you all prefer to live
together in peace in the netherworld?

00:07:22.660 --> 00:07:24.390
Damn you!

00:07:36.000 --> 00:07:37.230
Who's there!?

00:07:40.010 --> 00:07:41.440
Bro!

00:07:43.340 --> 00:07:46.140
Quit terrorizing people.

00:07:51.690 --> 00:07:53.250
Get lost.

00:07:54.360 --> 00:07:57.150
I'll let you go for today!

00:08:02.630 --> 00:08:03.970
Hello?

00:08:03.970 --> 00:08:05.970
Oh hi, Sven...

00:08:05.970 --> 00:08:09.300
You're here already? That was quick.

00:08:09.300 --> 00:08:10.970
So where are you now?

00:08:10.970 --> 00:08:12.500
Behind you.

00:08:17.980 --> 00:08:19.240
Yo!

00:08:29.320 --> 00:08:32.330
Even if you ask me how to fix it,

00:08:32.330 --> 00:08:38.000
I didn't find any info during that nanotech
incident at the Torneo mansion, so...

00:08:38.000 --> 00:08:40.670
I see...

00:08:40.670 --> 00:08:43.340
Is Train's condition that serious?

00:08:43.340 --> 00:08:47.680
So far it's not that serious,

00:08:47.680 --> 00:08:50.940
But there's no guarantee
that things will remain that way.

00:08:52.010 --> 00:08:56.020
Okay, I'll try digging up
some information about it.

00:08:56.020 --> 00:08:57.250
Thanks.

00:09:01.290 --> 00:09:03.290
Oh! It's Tim!

00:09:03.290 --> 00:09:05.090
Welcome back!

00:09:10.300 --> 00:09:13.300
Welcome back, Tim.

00:09:13.300 --> 00:09:15.400
Hey Layla.

00:09:23.980 --> 00:09:26.650
Those gangsters beat you up again,
didn't they?

00:09:26.650 --> 00:09:28.980
It's nothing. Just leave me alone!

00:09:28.980 --> 00:09:31.850
What're you saying? You're hurt!

00:09:33.320 --> 00:09:35.660
You said your name was Train, right?

00:09:35.660 --> 00:09:37.990
Would you help us?

00:09:37.990 --> 00:09:39.660
For what?

00:09:39.660 --> 00:09:43.000
Gangsters are after this old factory site.

00:09:43.000 --> 00:09:47.340
They say they want to build
some huge amusement center here.

00:09:47.340 --> 00:09:48.670
And?

00:09:48.670 --> 00:09:50.670
We want to protect our home!

00:09:50.670 --> 00:09:54.340
In order to drive them away,
we need someone strong!

00:09:59.680 --> 00:10:03.080
No thanks... It has nothing to do with me.

00:10:04.690 --> 00:10:06.020
Dammit!

00:10:06.020 --> 00:10:09.360
Tell me your story.

00:10:09.360 --> 00:10:12.690
We're all orphans.

00:10:12.690 --> 00:10:14.360
Some of us lost our parents in the civil war,

00:10:14.360 --> 00:10:16.700
while others were abandoned
for one reason or another.

00:10:16.700 --> 00:10:22.370
We all did odd jobs like polishing shoes
and lived a very quiet life...

00:10:22.370 --> 00:10:26.040
That is, until the gangsters appeared.

00:10:26.040 --> 00:10:30.380
Tim's parents were killed by gangsters.

00:10:30.380 --> 00:10:33.050
So he's been adamant
about taking revenge.

00:10:33.050 --> 00:10:38.720
Dammit! Why isn't he here
at a time like this!?

00:10:38.720 --> 00:10:40.720
Who is he talking about?

00:10:40.720 --> 00:10:43.390
The former leader of this place.

00:10:43.390 --> 00:10:47.060
Our precious friend.

00:10:47.060 --> 00:10:50.120
Precious friend...

00:10:51.070 --> 00:10:52.730
Train...

00:10:52.730 --> 00:10:54.070
Princess...

00:10:54.070 --> 00:10:57.410
Tim is determined to defeat the gang,
even if he has to do it alone...

00:10:57.410 --> 00:11:00.670
in order to protect everyone,
and to take revenge.

00:11:00.670 --> 00:11:02.340
Revenge?

00:11:02.340 --> 00:11:04.010
Yes.

00:11:04.010 --> 00:11:05.780
Taking revenge...

00:11:07.010 --> 00:11:14.020
117... 118... 119...

00:11:14.020 --> 00:11:18.360
120... 121...

00:11:18.360 --> 00:11:22.260
What's wrong?
If you stop to rest, you're dead.

00:11:23.360 --> 00:11:25.700
122...

00:11:25.700 --> 00:11:29.160
Drink, it's milk.

00:11:30.700 --> 00:11:32.710
Don't want any.

00:11:32.710 --> 00:11:34.380
Just drink it.

00:11:34.380 --> 00:11:37.380
It tastes good and it's good for you.
There's no harm in it.

00:11:37.380 --> 00:11:40.710
If you want to get strong, drink it.

00:11:40.710 --> 00:11:42.480
Get strong...

00:11:46.050 --> 00:11:47.390
That's stupid...

00:11:47.390 --> 00:11:50.720
I'm going to stay here for a while.

00:11:50.720 --> 00:11:51.730
What?

00:11:51.730 --> 00:11:56.400
Because Tim is doing everything
he can to protect his friends.

00:11:56.400 --> 00:12:01.000
I want to protect Tim and everyone here.

00:12:01.000 --> 00:12:02.770
Princess...

00:12:27.030 --> 00:12:31.490
So the burden on my shoulder
really is more than I thought...

00:12:39.370 --> 00:12:41.380
You were too rash.

00:12:41.380 --> 00:12:45.380
When you want to kill your enemy,
don't aim for his head.

00:12:45.380 --> 00:12:48.720
The head is a small target,
so it's difficult to aim for.

00:12:48.720 --> 00:12:50.720
Aim for the heart.

00:12:50.720 --> 00:12:54.050
If you aim for the heart, even if you miss,
you're sure to hit somewhere else.

00:12:54.050 --> 00:12:56.060
And, train to strengthen your arm.

00:12:56.060 --> 00:12:59.150
You can forget about it,
if you can't handle the recoil.

00:13:00.060 --> 00:13:03.000
I'll... kill you!

00:13:03.000 --> 00:13:06.330
At least your desire to kill
is that of a man's...

00:13:06.330 --> 00:13:09.330
Getting revenge, huh...

00:13:16.340 --> 00:13:20.280
Such tight security
on every site I've checked!

00:13:24.350 --> 00:13:26.250
This name...

00:13:27.690 --> 00:13:32.030
"Tearju Lunatique...
an authority on nanotechnology...

00:13:32.030 --> 00:13:36.700
Was active in various fields
related to nanotech at the age of 14."

00:13:36.700 --> 00:13:40.030
I see, if I find her...

00:13:41.040 --> 00:13:43.040
"Present whereabouts unknown...

00:13:43.040 --> 00:13:46.040
One of her specialties is making omelets,

00:13:46.040 --> 00:13:49.040
however, taste may vary."

00:13:49.040 --> 00:13:50.980
Omelets?

00:13:52.710 --> 00:13:58.050
"When heated, NaPO albumin,
the primary component in proteins, will..."

00:13:58.050 --> 00:13:59.390
What the heck is this!?

00:13:59.390 --> 00:14:01.660
Yuck! What's this!?

00:14:01.660 --> 00:14:03.320
It's burnt black!

00:14:03.320 --> 00:14:05.990
I can't eat this stuff!

00:14:05.990 --> 00:14:08.330
Now, now! Don't be so rude!

00:14:08.330 --> 00:14:10.660
But...

00:14:10.660 --> 00:14:13.030
Eve, uhm...

00:14:14.340 --> 00:14:16.670
Hey, looks good!

00:14:16.670 --> 00:14:18.340
Huh?

00:14:18.340 --> 00:14:22.010
Hey, what's this black thing?

00:14:22.010 --> 00:14:23.680
An omelet.

00:14:23.680 --> 00:14:26.770
Oh, did you make it, princess?

00:14:28.020 --> 00:14:29.780
Have some...

00:14:31.350 --> 00:14:32.350
Me!?

00:14:32.350 --> 00:14:34.360
Oh! Big-brother's gonna eat it!

00:14:34.360 --> 00:14:36.020
What!? No way!

00:14:36.020 --> 00:14:38.030
You're brave!

00:14:38.030 --> 00:14:48.020
--Eat it!
--Eat it!
--Eat it!

00:14:49.370 --> 00:14:51.710
--Eat it! Eat it! Ea...
--Eat it! Eat it! Ea...
--Eat it! Eat it! Ea...

00:14:51.710 --> 00:14:53.730
--Whoa!
--Whoa!
--Whoa!

00:14:57.710 --> 00:15:01.320
It tastes normal... just a bit burnt.

00:15:01.320 --> 00:15:03.580
Wow! That's amazing!

00:15:22.000 --> 00:15:23.970
Can't sleep?

00:15:26.010 --> 00:15:31.070
Until I came here, I always
gazed at the moon all alone.

00:15:36.680 --> 00:15:39.690
Say Eve, let's be friends.

00:15:39.690 --> 00:15:41.020
What?

00:15:41.020 --> 00:15:42.690
Say you will.

00:15:42.690 --> 00:15:45.360
S- sure...

00:15:45.360 --> 00:15:46.990
Thank you.

00:15:50.360 --> 00:15:53.130
You're not capable of using that.

00:15:57.040 --> 00:16:01.670
Did you think that you'd be able to avenge
your parents if only you had a gun?

00:16:03.980 --> 00:16:09.320
I wonder if Tim and Leon will be
happy for me for making friends with you...

00:16:09.320 --> 00:16:10.980
Leon?

00:16:10.980 --> 00:16:14.660
The former leader of this place...
the one I told you about earlier.

00:16:14.660 --> 00:16:17.660
He's away now, though.

00:16:17.660 --> 00:16:20.990
What is it!? Are you gonna lecture me?

00:16:20.990 --> 00:16:25.000
Don't do it. I'm not saying to
forget about avenging your parents,

00:16:25.000 --> 00:16:28.060
but you're the leader of this place,
aren't you?

00:16:29.670 --> 00:16:34.680
Tim is always so rash...
so I'm always worried.

00:16:34.680 --> 00:16:39.610
I mean... standing up to
those gangsters is too dangerous.

00:16:41.350 --> 00:16:46.690
Don't forget that there
are people who need you.

00:16:46.690 --> 00:16:48.490
If you die...

00:16:56.700 --> 00:16:58.600
Why?

00:17:02.300 --> 00:17:06.640
Why are you... covered in blood!?

00:17:06.640 --> 00:17:15.650
It seems that I was...
one of the powerless, too.

00:17:15.650 --> 00:17:17.990
What're you saying!?

00:17:17.990 --> 00:17:20.990
Listen well, Train.

00:17:20.990 --> 00:17:24.080
In this world, power is everything.

00:17:24.990 --> 00:17:27.330
Don't rely on anyone.

00:17:27.330 --> 00:17:31.000
The only one you can depend on,
is yourself.

00:17:31.000 --> 00:17:33.330
Hold on a second!

00:17:33.330 --> 00:17:35.600
You're my goal!

00:17:38.340 --> 00:17:42.010
I'm the one who killed your parents.

00:17:42.010 --> 00:17:45.640
And I'm... your goal... huh?

00:17:48.020 --> 00:17:53.010
If you want to become
better than me... live! By yourself!

00:17:58.690 --> 00:18:00.990
Become stronger than
anyone and anything,

00:18:00.990 --> 00:18:04.970
and prove that you're a survivor!

00:18:04.970 --> 00:18:07.400
Train Heartnet!

00:18:12.310 --> 00:18:15.640
I know that!

00:18:15.640 --> 00:18:18.940
I know that, but I...

00:18:20.310 --> 00:18:23.380
Eve, why are you a sweeper?

00:18:27.320 --> 00:18:30.660
I have someone who cares about me.

00:18:30.660 --> 00:18:32.990
Oh, a sweetheart?

00:18:38.330 --> 00:18:40.000
What's that?

00:18:40.000 --> 00:18:41.330
It's them!

00:18:45.670 --> 00:18:48.340
Everyone, stay inside.

00:18:48.340 --> 00:18:49.500
Tim!

00:18:51.680 --> 00:18:55.350
Hey you brats! You're leaving
this factory today for sure!

00:18:55.350 --> 00:18:56.680
Hey!

00:18:56.680 --> 00:18:59.020
Where's that kid from earlier today?

00:18:59.020 --> 00:19:01.620
Go away! This is our home!

00:19:01.620 --> 00:19:04.520
What!? You damned brat!

00:19:08.960 --> 00:19:10.450
Who the hell is that!?

00:19:32.320 --> 00:19:34.310
Hold it right there, you brat!

00:19:36.320 --> 00:19:38.660
Don't give us too much trouble!

00:19:38.660 --> 00:19:39.820
Meg!

00:19:41.660 --> 00:19:44.660
Ha! First, hand over his gun!

00:19:51.000 --> 00:19:53.340
If I give it to you,
will you release the girl?

00:19:53.340 --> 00:19:54.930
Sure.

00:20:01.010 --> 00:20:02.410
What the!?

00:20:06.690 --> 00:20:08.210
Damn you!

00:20:10.020 --> 00:20:11.150
Layla!

00:20:14.360 --> 00:20:16.300
Wanna finish him?

00:20:17.360 --> 00:20:19.390
You decide.

00:20:30.380 --> 00:20:31.680
Tim...

00:20:33.380 --> 00:20:34.970
Aren't you gonna shoot?

00:20:36.050 --> 00:20:39.390
He's not even worth killing!

00:20:39.390 --> 00:20:42.720
Don't ever show your face before us again!

00:20:42.720 --> 00:20:45.120
Get out of this town!!

00:21:01.010 --> 00:21:02.680
Where've you been?

00:21:02.680 --> 00:21:04.340
Just out.

00:21:04.340 --> 00:21:08.020
Sheesh! Who do you think
I'm running around for!?

00:21:08.020 --> 00:21:12.350
Huh? What's up, Eve?

00:21:12.350 --> 00:21:14.220
A sweetheart?

00:21:16.690 --> 00:21:19.690
No luck! Not a damned lead!

00:21:19.690 --> 00:21:22.660
Kuro-<i>sama</i>! Where are you?

00:21:26.370 --> 00:21:28.040
Train...

00:21:28.040 --> 00:21:30.370
Hey, he's not small!!

00:21:30.370 --> 00:21:32.370
You're... back to normal.

00:21:32.370 --> 00:21:34.040
No way!

00:21:34.040 --> 00:21:36.810
Huh? Oh yeah...

00:21:38.050 --> 00:21:40.380
Making us worry for nothing!

00:21:40.380 --> 00:21:43.050
Geez... All that trouble!

00:21:43.050 --> 00:21:46.050
I wonder if the hot water made you big...

00:21:46.050 --> 00:21:48.720
Train... you're just like...

00:21:48.720 --> 00:21:50.390
cup noodles.

00:21:50.390 --> 00:21:52.090
Wha!?

00:21:53.060 --> 00:21:55.730
It seems Black Cat is back to normal.

00:21:55.730 --> 00:21:59.400
Did the effect wear off? Or...

00:21:59.400 --> 00:22:01.330
Well, whatever...

00:22:01.330 --> 00:22:04.600
since we got some good data as a result.

00:22:14.010 --> 00:22:21.190
<i>Since your new black boots</i>
<i>caused a blister,</i>

00:22:21.190 --> 00:22:28.030
<i>you rest your right foot</i>

00:22:28.030 --> 00:22:38.030
<i>We'll keep walking along</i>
<i>with our own rhythm, without rushing</i>

00:22:41.710 --> 00:22:51.710
<i>Don't say anything</i>
<i>because we'll soon understand each other</i>

00:22:56.090 --> 00:23:06.090
<i>I'm just holding you now to keep you warm</i>

00:23:10.170 --> 00:23:20.170
<i>I'm completely wrapped around you, so...</i>

00:23:20.680 --> 00:23:30.680
<i>Quietly the powder-like snow</i>
<i>is building up...</i>

00:23:39.930 --> 00:23:42.030
"Next Episode"

00:23:42.030 --> 00:23:45.700
<i>Hmm... Thinking about it, it isn't</i>
<i>too bad living the easy life as a kid...</i>

00:23:45.700 --> 00:23:47.710
<i>How would you say it,</i>
<i>the burdens of relationships?</i>

00:23:47.710 --> 00:23:50.380
<i>You don't have to worry</i>
<i>about things like that, so...</i>

00:23:50.380 --> 00:23:53.380
<i>I mean, I shoulder</i>
<i>quite a few burdens myself.</i>

00:23:53.380 --> 00:23:56.720
<i>What? Sephiria is coming to see me?</i>

00:23:56.720 --> 00:23:58.050
<i>Oh, crap!</i>

00:23:58.050 --> 00:24:00.650
<i>That woman is scary!</i>

00:24:00.650 --> 00:24:01.890
<i>Maybe I should run!</i>

00:24:01.890 --> 00:24:04.860
"Receding Cat"
